      "id": 11,
      "options": {
        "content": "### Day-of ops (live counters)\nOpen **[5G IoT Lab Demo](/d/5g-iot-lab-demo)** for the presentation map + sensors. Open **[KPIs](/d/5g-iot-kpis)** for modeled vs measured RF/path.\n\n**This page:** live stat strip (same language as NTN super-ops): rate, online, PDR, RTT, modeled RSRP, ingest lag, jitter, CQI, gaps, duplicates.\n\n**Colors:** green / orange / red thresholds. Background-filled stats with sparkline. **RSRP / CQI are modeled.** Rate / PDR / RTT / lag / jitter / gaps are **measured**.\n\n**Plugins:** stock Grafana only (stat, timeseries, table, geomap). Datasource uid `timescaledb`.\n",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Ops \u00b7 live counters",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
